<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer - clarity in reform could boost investment.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer - clarity in reform could boost investment.</headline>
<dateline>ASCHAU, Germany 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Thursday that clarity on government reforms would help boost investment in Germany.</p>
<p>Tietmeyer made the comment at the Bundesbank's annual summer news conference following an out-of-town council meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
